# AURA Environment Variables
# Copy this to .env and fill in only what's needed.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI API Keys
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AURA supports user-configurable AI providers — keys are NOT
# stored in environment files. Go to:
#   Settings → AI → Providers
# to configure your preferred AI provider (Gemini, OpenAI,
# Groq, Anthropic, or local Ollama).
#
# Supported providers and where to get API keys:
#   Gemini:    https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#   OpenAI:    https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
#   Groq:      https://console.groq.com/keys
#   Anthropic: https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
#   Ollama:    https://ollama.com/download (no key needed, runs locally)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
